### Description
This Terraform program creates an AWS SageMaker model and an endpoint configuration for that model. The model is defined with a primary container that specifies the Docker image and model data URL. The endpoint configuration references this model and sets up a production variant with the necessary configurations.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "sagemaker_role" {
  name = "sagemaker-execution-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action = "sts:AssumeRole"
        Effect = "Allow"
        Principal = {
          Service = "sagemaker.amazonaws.com"
        }
      }
    ]
  })
}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment" "sagemaker_policy" {
  role       = aws_iam_role.sagemaker_role.name
  policy_arn = "arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AmazonSageMakerFullAccess"
}

resource "aws_sagemaker_model" "sagemaker_model" {
  name            = "my-sagemaker-model"
  execution_role_arn = aws_iam_role.sagemaker_role.arn

  primary_container {
    image           = "763104351884.dkr.ecr.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/tensorflow-inference:2.3.0-cpu-py37"
    model_data_url  = "s3://my-bucket/model.tar.gz"
  }
}

resource "aws_sagemaker_endpoint_configuration" "sagemaker_endpoint_configuration" {
  name = "my-sagemaker-endpoint-config"

  production_variants {
    variant_name           = "AllTraffic"
    model_name             = aws_sagemaker_model.sagemaker_model.name
    initial_instance_count = 1
    instance_type          = "ml.m5.large"
  }
}
```

### Explanation
1. **Provider Configuration**: The AWS provider is configured to use the `us-west-2` region.
2. **IAM Role**: An IAM role named `sagemaker-execution-role` is created with a trust policy allowing SageMaker to assume the role.
3. **IAM Role Policy Attachment**: The `AmazonSageMakerFullAccess` policy is attached to the IAM role to grant necessary permissions.
4. **SageMaker Model**: A SageMaker model is created with a primary container specifying the Docker image and model data URL.
5. **SageMaker Endpoint Configuration**: An endpoint configuration is created that references the SageMaker model and sets up a production variant with one instance of type `ml.m5.large`.

This configuration ensures that the SageMaker model and endpoint configuration are properly set up with the necessary dependencies and permissions.

