### Description
This Terraform program defines an AWS RDS option group named "option-group-pike" with the SQL Server Enterprise Edition (sqlserver-ee) engine and major engine version 11. It includes the options "SQLSERVER_AUDIT" and "TDE" within the option group.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"  # Specify the desired AWS region
}

resource "aws_db_option_group" "option_group_pike" {
  name                     = "option-group-pike"
  engine_name              = "sqlserver-ee"
  major_engine_version     = "11.00"

  option {
    option_name = "SQLSERVER_AUDIT"
  }

  option {
    option_name = "TDE"
  }
}
```

This configuration sets up the required AWS RDS option group with the specified engine and options. The `aws_db_option_group` resource is defined with the necessary attributes and nested blocks for the options.

